SUMMARY:   I use the term "Finitism" to label a new conceptual approach to 
relativistic quantum mechanics, RQM, starting with a different definition 
of Existence than 4th century B.C. Plato's cause and effect one, which led 
to, now outmoded, classical physics with its, Only bodies move bodies, minds 
cannot, therefore minds don't exist. CP began a 350 year separation of
humanists from science that we need to heal. The new definition of 
Existence that I offer is, For a 'fact' To Exist its 'possibility' must not
be 'excluded' and some other 'possibility' must. This leads to a definition
of Mind as the infinite, and reflexive, pattern of excluded and unexcluded 
possibilities made by the existence of its fact. These definitions lead to 
RQM much as Plato's led to classical physics.
 
HISTORY: Finitism is not exactly new. I began it in 1931, seeking the order 
underlying freshman chemistry at Georgia Tech. Within a year I had 
reinvented the notion that our universe might be the three-dimensional 
surface of a hypersphere. Mine had it composed of inertia-less
particles. Gravity involved their sinking into the depths at mass centers 
with a general upwelling back into space. The rest of our dynamic phenomena 
might involve kinematic motions of the surface particles.
    In 1948 Richard Courant, who I had met at NYU earlier on an air-
supported roof invention of mine, wrote to me, "To make a clear cut answer 
possible [to the worth of this, then, vague hypothesis] your assumptions 
should be formulated mathematically so that clear cut conclusions could be 
examined." Getting a mathematical toe-hold on the indeterminancy of inertia-
less particle behavior has taken me a near lifetime to formulate.
    In 1951 I began some correspondence with Bertrand Russell-- Has anyone 
examined the physical consequences of denying Whitehead's and your axiom of 
infinity?  With some sympathy for discreteness of time, he wryly observed, 
"Mathematics would be shorn of all its best parts, but that would be no 
loss except to the mathematician." This impelled me to explore an 
interactive dualism of finite versus infinite to keep a place for 
mathematics.
    In 1952 Albert Einstein, kindly responding to my new hypothesis of gravity
and distrust of infinity, wrote me, "The interesting question is if on logical 
grounds (simplicity) a plausible choice of axioms is possible [for a 
theory completely avoiding the notion of the continuum]." He also said, it was 
not simple and a concept of discontinuous time was needed.
    By 1968, 16 years later, I had finally worked out what has turned out 
to be a new and powerful definition of Existence. It has directly led to a 
general definition of Mind.
    In 1981 I retired after 45 years as a R & D engineer, mainly on mechanical 
structures, and went back to college, getting an M.S. in Physics (1986) but 
unable to get my novel ideas published, kept on with an M.A. in Professional 
Writing (1993) with somewhat better results. Now nearing age 81 I turn to 
ENET for fast turnaround of ideas, constructive criticism, and to invite 
you to carry on this synthesis.

EXISTENCE:   I start with three undefinables; 'possibilities', 'facts', and 
'to exclude'. I define, "For a 'fact' To Exist its 'possibility' must not be 
'excluded' and some other 'possibility' must." While possibilities can Be 
infinite and eternal, facts must Exist finite and changing under this 
definition, An infinite group of facts from which as many as needed may be 
withdrawn without excluding the possibility of drawing more [axiom of 
infinity] contradicts this definition of existence.

MIND:   My definition of mind immediately follows. "A Mind is the pattern 
of all [infinite and reflexive] 'possibilities' as 'excluded' and left 
unexcluded by the existence of its 'fact'." Most minds are not conscious 
but this definition covers at least three types of mind which may have 
achieved self-conscious. Our own minds are one. We use Is as evenly excluded 
possibilities i.e. excluded from exclusion, and we use Not as odd excluded.
    Another type is the primordial First-Mind, defined as the pattern of all 
'possibilities' with none of them 'excluded' when nothing exists. 'To 
exclude', or Creativity, acted intermittantly through eternity-past, 
ultimately created many ill-defined, vague, short lived, disconnected
fact-units. It also acted on the first-mind who speeded up this creativity,
made facts more definite, connected, and, through a chaos of its own making,
achieved consciousness, self-consciousness, and became what theologians 
call"God the Creator."
    As facts became more definite, limited, by multiple overlapping 
exclusions during the first-mind's creative chaos, the end product, vast 
numbers of least-unit somethings, were created. Since Nothing is the 
absence of exclusionary limits, Somethings exist as almost completely 
limited facts.

LEAST-UNITS:   I define, "A Least-unit as a 'fact' whose existence 
'excludes' All 'possibilities' Except of its existing separately or in 
changing contact with up to five other least-units" -- a fourth- 
dimensional specification by the first-mind.

COSMOLOGY: At Creation, the first-mind started all these least-units to 
slowly drift toward one place where contacts would be more frequent. As 
random contacts became critically frequent, the least-unit minds began 
excluding possibilities of separation and thus began to aggregate. They
compacted, built up a notion of discrete time and space from experience
interchanges (communication), and formed a figure of minimum surface-- a
hypersphere.
    Successive aggregations of least-units reaching critical frequency 
around the edge of the void surrounding the hypersphere, form hyper-
bubbles which thicken contract and draw down on the old hypersphere
forming a new surface, now at multi-billion year intervals. My hope for
testing this new cosmology rests upon our new space and land based
telescopic instruments showing phenomena incompatible with the big-bang
theory when observing the last accretion incident perhaps l0 billion years
ago in distance and time.

RQM:  20th century relativistic quantum mechanics differs from 17th century 
classical physics, which assumed Forces emanate from Mass posessing 
particles, by increasingly abandoning the force concept in favor of Fields 
of possible action generated in space itself rather than emanating from
point sources. Now, particle physics is beginning to suffer from eroding
public support losing faith in its ability to ultimately answer the Why 
of everything. RQM needs to develop its own explanatory Why to match its 
wildly successful descriptive How.
    One way! Inertia-less particles have only two speeds: relativistic zero 
without motion, experiencing discrete time and space; and moving at light 
speed, experiencing no time change. In the depths of the fourth-dimensional
aggregation a filament of inertia-less least-units moving at light speed
in single file, involve a probability of one least-unit along its path
suddenly finding itself moved from its original place and having to reset
its clock and its location in coordination with its new neighbors. 
   Similarly, communication from one minded least-unit to the next involves
generating a new interval of time and traveling one least-unit of distance
-- light speed. From de Broglie waves of a moving proton and slanted surface,
I calculate that a least-unit's fuzzy size averages 1/3 of a nucleon's
diameter and the smallest fuzzy interval of time is about 10 to the -23
seconds. Fuzzy means "one" greater than "zero" and less than "two", an
inherent indeterminancy at this fundamental level of size. Indetermanancy 
prevents smaller measurements, and precision is only achieved statistically.

Q/M FIELDS:  Nucleons of matter are associated with a single file sink 
moving at light speed into the depths of the hypersphere. Surface least- 
units seek to be drawn into the depths to complete all their possible 
contacts. By excluding possibilities of moving away from the sink, or 
clusters of sinks, those around one can increase their chance of moving 
closer to it. Thus in total, the least-unit minds set up a gravitational
field of possibility exclusions where each place in space has a directed
vector of strength equal to the probability of each least-unit eventually
being submerged after a long time of moving closer to the sink. This is an 
inverse square strength phenomena-- a space generated quantum mechanical 
field, not Forces emanating from the sink.
    Around the sink, inflow conditions develop nuclear and atomic phenomena,  
hopefully, not inconsistent with what RQM describes mathematically.
    Electric fields are 10 to the 39th power stronger in that they involve 
a surface-subsurface counterflow motion system that offers least-units a 
chance of immediate submergence if they exclude possibilities unfavorable 
to this. I suspect that the basic element in an electron or positron is one 
submergence or emergence per least interval of time, but occuring 
discontigulously about its average location, unlike a nucleonic sink 
happening at one place or adjacent to it.

RADIATION:  I am coming to think that radiation involves separate 
least-units individually moving at light speed averaging one per least 
interval of time, and more closely distributed as the amount of energy being 
transported is greater, thus higher frequency. When one of these systems
comes near a distributed electron which can absorb the energy at that
frequency, interaction occurs or vice versa.

INVITATION:  Thus quantum mechanics appears conceptually reasonable with 
Finitism. I hope physicists, mathematicians, cosmologists, and computer 
simulation whizzs will take it up. There are also psychological, societal,
and theological ramifications to explore. See sci.philosophy.meta and 
umassd.cogsci discussion groups as well as alt.sci.physics.new-theories.
